    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφορ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to</i> or <i>producing expression</i>:
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ</span>. <i>the power of
				expressing oneself in words</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1113c
			</span></i>; but, <i>capable of being expressed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.77
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1112d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
